  "title": "Completed Pre-Vote round elects a node that left the voters; its self-grant panics RaftCore",
  "cause": "handle_pre_vote_resp calls elect() without the is_voter check performed by every old elect() caller; do_elect then builds a candidate over voters that exclude the node and the runtime's local self-grant reaches Candidate::grant_by, whose expect panics.",
  "trigger": "A Pre-Vote round is in flight on a leader (explicit trigger().elect(true), or a stale timer round from MC-1) while the leader removes itself from the voters (kept as learner); the round's grants arrive after the change.",
  "consequence": "RaftCore panics ('target not in quorum set') and the node stops serving (Fatal::Panicked), in debug and release builds.",
  "sites": [
    "openraft/src/engine/engine_impl.rs:handle_pre_vote_resp",
    "openraft/src/engine/engine_impl.rs:do_elect",
    "openraft/src/proposer/candidate.rs:grant_by"
  ],
  "actions": [
    "HandlePreVoteResponse",
    "ElectEffects",
    "PersistVote",
    "HandleVoteResponse"
  ],
  "invariants": [
    "CandidateGrantsWithinFrozenVoters"
  ],
  "premises": [
    "A Pre-Vote round can be in flight on a leader (explicit trigger accepts any voter; MC-1 keeps timer rounds).",
    "A leader may remove itself from the voters while retained as learner and keeps running until it steps down.",
    "The runtime sends a local granted VoteResponse after every non-committed SaveVote."
  ],
